-- WoW Forever: creature templates for NPCs players met on the live realm that our world has no template for.
-- Templates only (name, title, type, family, class, elite/rare, models, health/power multipliers, difficulty and movement ids,
-- type flags). No spawns, loot or scripts: nothing changes in game until those are added, but quests, spawns and dungeon
-- work can now point at them.
-- Data from Efficient Games (https://efficient.games), licensed under CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
-- Source: github.com/JIVESCORP/eg-link-output-wowf (creature_details from players' game caches, creatures/npcs datasets),
-- builds 1.60.1.70205-70959. Changed: picked and converted to our tables.
-- ESTIMATED (not in the data): faction from what players saw (hostile 16, both sides 35, Alliance 12, Horde 29, neutral 7),
-- damage modifier (elite/boss 2.0, others 1.0), attack speed 2000. Levels only where players saw them.
-- VerifiedBuild -1 marks these rows as estimated. Safe to run again: rows are replaced by key.
